---
// The product shot on the homepage: a static mock of the app's early "Storage overview".
// Decision 24 replaces it with a real light/dark screenshot of the shipping Overview at launch.
// #8A8A90 and the 7px/9px radii have no token in the design system, so they stay literal.
---
<style is:global>
@media (max-width:760px){.win-side{display:none !important}}
</style>
<figure aria-label="The CacheDrop app, showing the Storage overview" style="margin: var(--space-20) 0 0; width: 100%; max-width: var(--window-max); text-align: left; border-radius: var(--radius-xl); overflow: hidden; background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); box-shadow: var(--shadow-window)">
<div style="height: 38px; padding: 0 14px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); background: var(--window-chrome); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line)">
<span style="width: var(--icon-xs); height: var(--icon-xs); border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--traffic-close)"></span>
<span style="width: var(--icon-xs); height: var(--icon-xs); border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--traffic-minimize)"></span>
<span style="width: var(--icon-xs); height: var(--icon-xs); border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--traffic-zoom)"></span>
<span style="margin-left: var(--space-2-5); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink-secondary)">CacheDrop</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap">
<div class="win-side" style="flex: 0 0 220px; min-height: 540px; padding: var(--space-4) var(--space-2-5); display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; background: var(--window-sidebar); border-right: 1px solid var(--line)">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-5)">
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-0-5); font-size: 13px">
<div style="padding: 0 var(--space-2-5) var(--space-1-5); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8A8A90">Storage</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-2-5); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); background: var(--window-selected); color: var(--ink); font-weight: 500">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true" style="stroke: var(--accent)"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="10" rx="3"></rect><path d="M11 12h6"></path><path d="M7 12h.01"></path></svg>
<span>Overview</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-2-5); color: var(--ink-secondary)">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4l1.8 4.2L18 10l-4.2 1.8L12 16l-1.8-4.2L6 10l4.2-1.8z"></path></svg>
<span>Smart clean</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-2-5); color: var(--ink-secondary)">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M9 7h11M9 12h11M9 17h11M4.5 7h.01M4.5 12h.01M4.5 17h.01"></path></svg>
<span>Cleanup plan</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-2-5); color: var(--ink-secondary)">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 17l5-5 4 3 7-8"></path></svg>
<span>Storage trends</span>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-2-5); color: var(--ink-secondary)">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="8"></circle><path d="M12 8v4l3 2"></path></svg>
<span>History</span>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-0-5); font-size: 13px">
<div style="padding: 0 var(--space-2-5) var(--space-1-5); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.04em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #8A8A90">Settings</div>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-2-5); color: var(--ink-secondary)">
<svg width="16" height="16" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M3 7.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 4.5 6H9l2 2h8.5A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 21 9.5v8a1.5 1.5 0 0 1-1.5 1.5h-15A1.5 1.5 0 0 1 3 17.5z"></path></svg>
<span>Locations &amp; access</span>
</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="padding: var(--space-3); border-radius: var(--radius-md); background: var(--surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink)">
<svg width="14" height="14" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="5" y="5" width="14" height="10" rx="1.5"></rect><path d="M3 19h18"></path></svg>
<span>This Mac</span>
</div>
<div style="font-size: 11px; line-height: 15px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">31.29 GB available of 245.11 GB</div>
<div style="height: 4px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--track); overflow: hidden"><div style="width: 87%; height: 100%; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: #8A8A90"></div></div>
</div>
</div>

<div style="flex: 999 1 480px; min-width: 0; padding: var(--space-7) var(--space-8); background: var(--surface); color: var(--ink); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: flex-start; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-4)">
<div>
<div style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em">Storage overview</div>
<div style="margin-top: var(--space-0-5); font-size: 13px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">A clearer picture of what’s on your Mac.</div>
</div>
<span style="padding: var(--space-1-5) var(--space-3); border-radius: var(--radius-sm); border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-elevated); font-size: 12px; font-weight: 500">Scan again</span>
</div>

<div style="padding: 18px; border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3)">
<div style="width: var(--control-md); height: var(--control-md); border-radius: var(--radius-md); border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; color: var(--ink-secondary)">
<svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="7" width="18" height="10" rx="3"></rect><path d="M11 12h6"></path><path d="M7 12h.01"></path></svg>
</div>
<div>
<div style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600">Macintosh HD</div>
<div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">Startup volume · 245.11 GB</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right">
<div style="font-size: 20px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 1">31.29 GB</div>
<div style="margin-top: var(--space-1); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">available</div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="height: 8px; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--track); overflow: hidden"><div style="width: 87.2%; height: 100%; border-radius: var(--radius-full); background: var(--accent)"></div></div>
<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)"><span>213.82 GB used</span><span>Whole-disk capacity</span></div>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3); padding-bottom: 14px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 12px">
<div style="display: flex; gap: var(--space-1-5); color: var(--ink-secondary)"><span style="font-weight: 500; color: var(--ink)">Scanned locations</span><span>·</span><span>4 recognized cache locations</span></div>
<span style="padding: var(--space-1) var(--space-2-5); border-radius: 7px; border: 1px solid var(--line); background: var(--surface-elevated); font-size: 11px">Scan a folder…</span>
</div>

<div style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: var(--space-2-5)">
<div style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-2); font-size: 12px">
<span style="font-weight: 600">Recommended for review</span>
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-2-5); font-size: 11px"><span style="color: var(--ink-secondary)">About 3.7 GB estimated</span><span style="color: var(--accent-text); font-weight: 500">Smart clean ›</span></div>
</div>
<div style="padding: var(--space-3); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); min-width: 0">
<div style="flex: none; width: var(--tile-sm); height: var(--tile-sm); border-radius: 9px; background: var(--cat-dev-soft); color: var(--cat-dev); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="3"></rect><path d="M7 10l3 2-3 2"></path><path d="M13 15h4"></path></svg>
</div>
<div style="min-width: 0"><div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Developer caches and build files</div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">Package caches and build files that tools rebuild</div></div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right; flex: none"><div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600">About 3.7 GB</div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">Review files ›</div></div>
</div>
<div style="padding: var(--space-3); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); background: var(--surface-elevated); border: 1px solid var(--line); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: var(--space-3)">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: var(--space-3); min-width: 0">
<div style="flex: none; width: var(--tile-sm); height: var(--tile-sm); border-radius: 9px; background: var(--cat-downloads-soft); color: var(--cat-downloads); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center">
<svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M4 8l8-4 8 4v8l-8 4-8-4z"></path><path d="M4 8l8 4 8-4"></path><path d="M12 12v8"></path></svg>
</div>
<div style="min-width: 0"><div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500">Downloads to review</div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">Installers and large files you haven’t opened lately</div></div>
</div>
<div style="text-align: right; flex: none"><div style="font-size: 13px; font-weight: 600">123 KB</div><div style="font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">Review files ›</div></div>
</div>
</div>
<div style="margin-top: auto; padding-top: 14px; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); font-size: 11px; color: var(--ink-secondary)">Estimated release excludes 123 KB proposed for Trash.</div>
</div>
</div>
</figure>
